    "80020201": "I must say, I envy you for having the leisure to throw a little tea party.",
    "80020202": "If I were you, I'd take on more commissions.",
    "80020203": "Then there's the Elysian Church in the south. The truce is only temporary. No one can say when war will break out again.",
